# Block Agent / Tab / @-mention access to secret files.
# .gitignore only affects indexing; this is what stops Read/Grep on .env.
# Terminal can still reach these files — never cat/Get-Content them.

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example

# Common secret dumps (none should exist; keep blocked anyway)
**/*credentials*.json
**/*secrets*.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key
!mobile/app.json
